/-!
exercise: exercise_4193
Original problem source follows.


===== ORIGINAL | Exercise 4193 =====
【4193】 讨论三重积分 $\mathop{\iiint }\limits_{{\left| x\right|  + \left| y\right|  + \left| z\right|  > 1}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{\left| x\right| }^{p} + {\left| y\right| }^{q} + {\left| z\right| }^{r}}\;\left( {p > 0,q > 0,r > 0}\right)$ 的收敛性.

解 由对称性及被积函数的非负性, 有

$$
{\iiint }_{\left| x\right|  + \left| y\right|  + \left| z\right|  > 1}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{\left| x\right| }^{p} + {\left| y\right| }^{q} + {\left| z\right| }^{r}} = 8{\iiint }_{\begin{matrix} {x \geq  0,y \geq  0,z \geq  0} \\  {x + y + z \geq  1} \end{matrix}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r}} = 8{\iiint }_{{\Omega }_{1}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r}} + 8{\iiint }_{{\Omega }_{2}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r}}.
$$

其中,令

$$
{\Omega }_{1} = \left\{  {\left( {x,y,z}\right)  \mid  x \geq  0,y \geq  0,z \geq  0,x + y + z > 1,{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r} \leq  3}\right\}  ,
$$

$$
{\Omega }_{2} = \left\{  {\left( {x,y,z}\right)  \mid  x \geq  0,y \geq  0,z \geq  0,x + y + z > 1,{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r} > 3}\right\}  .
$$

令 ${\Omega }_{3} = \left\{  {\left( {x,y,z}\right)  \mid  x \geq  0,y \geq  0,z \geq  0,{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r} > 3}\right\}$ ,由于当 $x \geq  0,y \geq  0,z \geq  0,{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r} > 3$ 时必有 $x + y$ $+ z > 1$ (否则, $x + y + z \leq  1$ ,就有 $x \leq  1,y \leq  1,z \leq  1$ ,从而, ${x}^{p} \leq  1,{y}^{q} \leq  1,{z}^{r} \leq  1$ ,于是 ${x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r} \leq  3$ ),故 ${\Omega }_{2} =$ ${\Omega }_{3}$ . 显然, ${\iiint }_{{\Omega }_{3}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r}}$ 为常义积分,故积分 ${\iiint }_{\left| x\right|  + \left| y\right|  + \left| z\right|  > 1}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{\left| x\right| }^{p} + {\left| y\right| }^{q} + {\left| z\right| }^{r}}$ 的敛散性取决于 ${\iiint }_{{\Omega }_{3}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r}}$ 的敛散性. 对此积分, 作变量代换

$$
x = {R}^{\frac{2}{p}}{\cos }^{\frac{2}{p}}\varphi {\cos }^{\frac{2}{p}}\psi ,\;y = {R}^{\frac{2}{q}}{\sin }^{\frac{2}{q}}\varphi {\cos }^{\frac{2}{q}}\psi ,\;z = {R}^{\frac{2}{r}}{\sin }^{\frac{2}{r}}\psi，其中 $R>\sqrt{3},0\leq \varphi \leq \frac{\pi}{2},0\leq \psi \leq \frac{\pi}{2}$ .
$$

则易知

$$
\frac{D\left( {x,y,z}\right) }{D\left( {R,\varphi ,\psi }\right) } = \frac{8}{pqr}{R}^{\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} + \frac{2}{r} - 1}{\cos }^{\frac{2}{p} - 1}\varphi {\sin }^{\frac{2}{q} - 1}\varphi {\sin }^{\frac{2}{r} - 1}\psi {\cos }^{\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} - 1}\psi .
$$

于是, 由被积函数的非负性, 并利用 3856 题的结果, 得

$$
{\iiint }_{{\Omega }_{3}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r}} = \frac{8}{pqr}{\int }_{0}^{\frac{\pi }{2}}{\sin }^{\frac{2}{r} - 1}\psi {\cos }^{\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} - 1}\psi \mathrm{d}\psi  \cdot  {\int }_{0}^{\frac{\pi }{2}}{\sin }^{\frac{2}{q} - 1}\psi {\cos }^{\frac{2}{p} - 1}\varphi \mathrm{d}\varphi  \cdot  {\int }_{\sqrt{3}}^{+\infty }{R}^{\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} + \frac{2}{r} - 3}\mathrm{\;d}R
$$

$$
= \frac{8}{pqr} \cdot  \frac{1}{2}\mathrm{\;B}\left( {\frac{1}{r},\frac{1}{p} + \frac{1}{q}}\right)  \cdot  \frac{1}{2}\mathrm{\;B}\left( {\frac{1}{q},\frac{1}{p}}\right) {\int }_{\sqrt{3}}^{+\infty }{R}^{\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} + \frac{2}{r} - 3}\mathrm{\;d}R
$$

$$
= \frac{2}{pqr}\mathrm{\;B}\left( {\frac{1}{r},\frac{1}{p} + \frac{1}{q}}\right) \mathrm{B}\left( {\frac{1}{q},\frac{1}{p}}\right) {\int }_{\sqrt{3}}^{+\infty }{R}^{\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} + \frac{2}{r} - 3}\mathrm{\;d}R.
$$

由于积分 ${\int }_{\sqrt{3}}^{+\infty }{R}^{\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} + \frac{2}{r} - 3}\mathrm{\;d}R$ 当 $\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} + \frac{2}{r} - 3 <  - 1$ (即 $\frac{1}{p} + \frac{1}{q} + \frac{1}{r} < 1$ ) 时收敛,当 $\frac{2}{p} + \frac{2}{q} + \frac{2}{r} - 3$ $\geq   - 1$ 时发散,故积分 ${\iiint }_{{\Omega }_{3}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{x}^{p} + {y}^{q} + {z}^{r}}$ (从而,积分 $\mathop{\iiint }\limits_{{\left| x\right|  + \left| y\right|  + \left| z\right|  > 1}}\frac{\mathrm{d}x\mathrm{\;d}y\mathrm{\;d}z}{{\left| x\right| }^{p} + {\left| y\right| }^{q} + {\left| z\right| }^{r}}$ )当 $\frac{1}{p} + \frac{1}{q} + \frac{1}{r} < 1$ 时收敛,当 $\frac{1}{p} + \frac{1}{q} + \frac{1}{r} \geq  1$ 时发散.

-/

